{"type":"message","id":"5bf5ff75","parentId":"b26f6018","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:32:58.711Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 收到，我接着往下做。\n\n上一步已经把 **OpenClaw 贡献流程 / PR / CI / review 注意事项**整理出来了。  \n现在可以直接继续做这 3 个落地件，我建议一次补齐：\n\n1. **PR 描述模板**\n2. **review 回复模板**\n3. **首次贡献检查清单**\n\n如果你要我直接产出，我会按“可复制即用”来写，尽量别整虚的。  \n也可以告诉我你想放到哪：\n- 仓库里的 `docs/`\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md` 补充段落\n- 单独一个 `contributing-guide.md`\n\n你如果懒得选，我默认给你出一版 **Markdown 成稿**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_017784d6b786a0b80169c0b46767348191aa9c7784cd511239\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":20051,"output":174,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20225,"cost":{"input":0.050127500000000005,"output":0.00261,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.05273750000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774236773261}}
